===Adjective===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-adj}}

# [[inclusive]]; affecting the whole [[world]].
# {{lb|en|of a place|or|institution}} composed of [[people]] from all over the world.
# {{lb|en|of a person}} at [[ease]] in any part of the world.
# {{lb|en|biology|ecology}} [[growing]] or [[living]] in many parts of the world; widely distributed.

